-- Only documented API: Drawing.*, Windows.*, hooks.on_render,
-- tick, ScreenSize, Json, read_file/write_file, rbx, VK, notify.
-- No Roblox Instance.new, TweenService, game:GetService, or external execution.
-- Source reference: user's Source (1).lua (layout, palette, widget API).

